In the following code:
```
public static void Test2(int input, out int output) =&gt; output = input * 2;
public static int Test()
{
	int output;

void Apply(int input) =&gt; Test2(input, out output);

Apply(5);

return output;
}
```

The IDE mistakenly shows [IDE0018](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/fundamentals/code-analysis/style-rules/ide0018) at `int output`, and following its suggestion causes a compile error at `return output;`.

